<title>SPAIN: Spain harmonised May CPI 1.3 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Spain harmonised May CPI 1.3 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute (INE) gave the following figures:</p>
<p>						MAY 97    APRIL 97   MARCH 97</p>
<p>    Harmonised CPI year-on-year	1.3	   1.6	 2.2</p>
<p>    CPI, domestic calculation	  1.5	   1.7	 2.2</p>
<p>Maximum level that still</p>
<p>    meets Maastricht's criteria	2.5	   2.4	 2.5</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
